<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-chrysomallon-squamiferum-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg fastest-mode wavelength at 2.0 nm on Chrysomallon squamiferum (Pass 2) — Model fidelity to source: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 keeps Schnakenberg kinetics and distinguishes the onset wavenumber from argmax σ(k). Diffusivities are scaled so the linear peak tracks the requested wavelength, with one nonlinear correction. The biology sources still do not contain this PDE; the transfer is stated rather than hidden." ;
